# Day plan

On session start (`session-start` skill), after bootstrap:

1. Jira/query assignee open work
2. Open PRs (`gh pr list`)
3. Produce calendar + work blocks with hour budget (`dailyReport.targetHoursPerDay` in config)
4. **Do not start implementation** until the user confirms the plan or picks a block

Tickets waiting only on external feedback get one line under **Waiting on feedback** — no planned hours.
